## Device-validation evidence (produced by tools/device-validation, never committed)
##
## A run records what one specific machine did, including its name and its
## accounts' SIDs. It is redacted of secrets by construction, and it still
## belongs to the operator who produced it rather than to the repository.
validation-results/

## The operator's own validation config, which names a real machine and real
## accounts. device-validation.example.json is the one that is committed.
tools/device-validation/device-validation.json
